# The lantern, low (#158), eats something that isn't the remedy (#207).
# Played by the SupperTable when the galley bell is rung. He's grateful, but
# still cold, and hints at what he needs: something warmer, with a bite.
# Placeholder writing: rewrite freely.

~ start
@go lantern supper_bowl
@wait 1.5
@look lantern tired
lantern: Mm. Thank you. That was kind.
lantern: I'm still so cold, though...
lantern: Something warmer, maybe? Something with a bit of fire in it.
@home lantern
-> END
